{"title":"2021 GMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_GMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06a943c7409458c52c19cd2f6f5733c99a05d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5!-4!+3!-2!+1!-0!?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"204\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fddd32903d22a64a96a5f29f9b0c5e1ae70e97bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} ~99 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} ~100 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} ~101 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} ~102 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} ~103$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_GMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e0b3e083bda9a5a40dbff4245dad2d3daae871b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 5!-4!+3!-2!+1!-0! &amp;= 120 - 24 + 6 - 2 + 1 -1 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~100} \\end{align*}\" width=\"411\" height=\"53\" />\n~pineconee\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018015528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function co